                  </th>
                  <th className="px-4 py-2.5 text-right text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">
                    Puntos
                  </th>
                  <th className="px-4 py-2.5 text-right text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">
